// I-V-vi-IV in G (G D Em C), then in C (C G Am F, mini F): the loop under countless songs.
// Strum D - D U - U D U, ups on the top three strings. Capo anywhere to fit your voice.
\title "I-V-vi-IV in G and C"
\tempo 90
